        "source": "README.md Implementation and Static Analysis"
      }
    ],
    "notes": "This case is evaluated as a Platform/IPC security issue. Extra findings such as vulnerable minSdk, logging, hardcoded strings, or third-party library issues are not the target ground truth for this benchmark."
  },
